sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Queue as rpc_queue
    participant Server
    Client->>Queue: request (corr_id=abc, reply_to=amq.gen-...)
    Queue->>Server: deliver
    Server->>Server: compute
    Server->>Client: reply (corr_id=abc) via callback queue
    Client->>Client: match corr_id and return result
